# Reference level solution demo: delivery through straight-2 entrance and exit pair.
#
# Partially DEPRECATED - use typed entrypoints, see `27_level_typed.om[sl]`.
#
# The level file defines the starting conditions.
# The solution defines placement and actions.
#
# This is solution.
# The level defined in `examples/26_level_fixed.oml`

# Arm at (3,3), rotation 0
place arm 3 3                       # id 4

# Grab, then four clockwise swings moves pair onto exit, then release.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
